9">He </span><span begin="00:26.039" end="00:26.247">tells </span><span begin="00:26.247" end="00:26.503">his </span><span begin="00:26.503" end="00:26.774">friends </span><span begin="00:26.774" end="00:26.990">I </span><span begin="00:26.990" end="00:27.206">like </span><span begin="00:27.206" end="00:27.471">her</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.471" end="00:29.376"><span begin="00:27.471" end="00:27.686">'Cause </span><span begin="00:27.686" end="00:27.902">she's </span><span begin="00:27.902" end="00:28.152">so </span><span begin="00:28.152" end="00:28.375">much </span><span begin="00:28.375" end="00:28.864">smarter </span><span begin="00:28.864" end="00:29.094">than </span><span begin="00:29.094" end="00:29.376">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.646" end="00:33.106"><span begin="00:29.646" end="00:29.870">They're </span><span begin="00:29.870" end="00:30.331">having </span><span begin="00:30.331" end="00:30.646">talks </span><span begin="00:30.646" end="00:30.982">about </span><span begin="00:30.982" end="00:31.246">their </span><span begin="00:31.246" end="00:31.671">futures </span><span begin="00:31.671" end="00:32.135">until </span><span begin="00:32.135" end="00:32.478">4</span><span begin="00:32.478" end="00:33.106">AM</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.468" end="00:34.438"><span begin="00:33.468" end="00:33.610">And </span><span begin="00:33.610" end="00:33.769">I'm </span><span begin="00:33.769" end="00:34.009">happy </span><span begin="00:34.009" end="00:34.229">for </span><span begin="00:34.229" end="00:34.438">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.597" end="00:35.638"><span begin="00:34.597" end="00:34.790">I'm </span><span begin="00:34.790" end="00:35.005">happy </span><span begin="00:35.005" end="00:35.245">for </span><span begin="00:35.245" end="00:35.638">them</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.602" end="00:41.150"><span begin="00:37.602" end="00:37.817">But </span><span begin="00:37.817" end="00:38.183">I </s